>A question about dragon scale mail...
>I know that gray DSM is the best because it gives the wearer magic resistance,
>but do any other colors of DSM give the wearer special intrinsics? If a gray 
>dragon has the toughest skin (and therefore the best armor class), which 
>color dragon is the weakest?

	Dragon scale mail confers upon the wearer the same immunities that the
dragon itself posessed in life, with one exception.  Yellow dragon scale mail
does not make one immune to petrification.  All other varieties of dragon
scale mail are more or less intuitive with regard to what immunities they
confer.  (Red dragons are immune to fire; red dragon scale mail makes one
immune to fire, and so on.)

	All dragons have the same armor class, and all varieties of dragon
scale mail confer the same base armor class - 9.  A person who wore only +0
dragon scale mail would have an AC of 1.

